    "notes": "Exact Steam pin of the public head observed 2026-10-02 (native Linux dedicated server; depot 443032 manifest 8611640520811009059). The shipped connector is the native library libtakaro-conan-native.so (LD_PRELOAD into the server): it holds the Takaro connection itself, needs no RCON and no mod, and hooks only this build (GNU build-id 3a05a6ef0c873f2bbf754ec495bdf2a686d3768d, games/conan-exiles/native/core/pins/pins.json); on any other build it connects, reports the unknown build and refuses every action. It is built in its own pinned buster toolchain (games/conan-exiles/native/platform/linux/Dockerfile.build), so this record's build toolchain is the one the deprecated bridge zip is built in. The bridge (RCON + log files) is frozen and ships for one more release cycle. A hosted runner cannot boot the 4.3 GB server, so release verification is contract level."
  },
